WEBVTT

00:23.314 --> 00:24.149
Hello.

00:29.195 --> 00:30.697
Did you check the CCTV?

00:30.780 --> 00:32.532
Let me confirm.

00:40.373 --> 00:41.624
All four of them

00:42.500 --> 00:47.172
were decked out in black jackets,
black pants, and black masks.

00:47.672 --> 00:49.174
They were all big guys.

00:49.257 --> 00:52.177
How big are we talking?

00:52.260 --> 00:55.972
All four of them were over 180 cm.

00:56.056 --> 01:00.310
Two of them were about 187 or 188 cm.

01:00.393 --> 01:03.772
I could tell they worked out a lot.

01:03.855 --> 01:05.523
Some were MMA fighters.

01:06.024 --> 01:10.153
And they used batons
with a Taser function.

01:10.653 --> 01:14.157
They were wearing shoe covers.

01:14.741 --> 01:17.452
Have you noticed
anything unusual recently?

01:18.453 --> 01:19.370
Well…

01:21.498 --> 01:22.957
Go ahead. Tell him.

01:24.125 --> 01:27.879
Actually, some strangers came to our place
about three days ago.

01:27.962 --> 01:31.633
They were like, "You have to join
the boxing league we run."

01:31.716 --> 01:34.260
The league was called the IKFC.

01:34.344 --> 01:36.262
It was a threat, not a suggestion.

01:36.346 --> 01:38.264
The two of them were huge.

01:38.348 --> 01:40.767
They offered
a one-billion-won signing bonus.

01:40.850 --> 01:41.893
One billion?

01:42.894 --> 01:44.145
In cash.

01:45.355 --> 01:47.899
So you think it's linked to them?

01:47.982 --> 01:50.652
Yes, they made it sound like
they'd be back.

01:51.903 --> 01:54.489
I checked the CCTV, but it showed nothing.

01:54.572 --> 01:55.657
What?

01:56.241 --> 01:58.451
We just installed the CCTV.

01:58.952 --> 02:01.204
You shouldn't eavesdrop on us.

02:02.455 --> 02:03.832
I mean, I could hear you.

02:03.915 --> 02:05.583
Your voice was loud.

02:07.961 --> 02:09.087
I'm sorry.

02:10.630 --> 02:13.842
Anyway, the timestamp is moving,
but the screen is blank.

02:15.009 --> 02:15.844
Okay, go.

02:17.762 --> 02:19.305
Anything else you remember?

02:22.225 --> 02:25.019
We had the WBC Championship last week.

02:25.103 --> 02:26.855
-The opponent…
-Right?

02:26.938 --> 02:28.356
It was you, right?

02:29.774 --> 02:30.608
Oh, yes.

02:31.484 --> 02:33.736
-It's an honor.
-Thank you.

02:35.196 --> 02:37.365
I boxed a bit in middle school, too,

02:38.158 --> 02:40.326
so I watched your fights a few times.

02:41.119 --> 02:43.163
I'm sorry. Anyway…

02:43.788 --> 02:45.123
Please continue.

02:45.707 --> 02:47.876
I read that the opponent went missing.

02:47.959 --> 02:51.129
It makes me suspicious
that they're connected.

02:53.506 --> 02:54.632
I understand.

02:55.133 --> 02:57.969
I'll investigate it right away.

02:59.721 --> 03:02.849
This house might be unsafe.
You should stay elsewhere.

03:07.854 --> 03:09.314
Then, Detective,

03:10.190 --> 03:11.691
would a hotel work?

03:12.275 --> 03:14.444
You should avoid crowded places.

03:16.738 --> 03:17.947
Where should we go?

03:22.535 --> 03:23.536
Tae-yeong's place?

03:40.345 --> 03:41.512
Hello.

03:42.555 --> 03:43.848
-Hello.
-Yes, hello.

03:43.932 --> 03:45.225
-Hello.
-Detective Choi.

03:46.517 --> 03:48.561
This is where the fire started.

03:48.645 --> 03:50.563
See the melted gas container?

03:50.647 --> 03:52.273
It's a makeshift explosive.

03:52.357 --> 03:55.777
Looks like the detonator was triggered
by a cell phone signal.

03:57.820 --> 04:01.699
How much expertise do you need to do this?

04:03.034 --> 04:05.912
You'd have to be
a high-level EOD technician.

04:08.831 --> 04:11.542
-We found a wallet in the car.
-Okay.

04:22.720 --> 04:23.554
I need…

04:23.638 --> 04:24.931
-Here you go.
-Thanks.

04:33.523 --> 04:36.901
MANAGER / BODYGUARD SON JIN-NAM

05:08.850 --> 05:11.436
BLOODHOUNDS 2

05:21.529 --> 05:23.072
-Thank you.
-No problem.

05:32.623 --> 05:34.042
Mom.

05:36.294 --> 05:37.712
Are you okay?

05:39.297 --> 05:40.256
Of course.

05:40.757 --> 05:43.718
I'm okay as long as you two are okay.

05:44.385 --> 05:45.720
We're okay, Mom.

05:46.387 --> 05:49.474
-It's a two-day fix for the windows.
-Okay.

05:51.142 --> 05:52.185
Our family,

05:52.894 --> 05:55.313
we'll get through this again.

05:55.813 --> 05:56.647
Yes.

06:02.195 --> 06:03.946
They're on the move.

06:05.740 --> 06:06.741
Turn right.

06:16.626 --> 06:17.877
Are they coming this way?

06:19.337 --> 06:20.380
Yes.

07:19.981 --> 07:21.023
2196!

07:21.524 --> 07:23.317
-2196!
-Go over there! Quick!

07:23.401 --> 07:24.777
2196!

07:24.861 --> 07:26.446
-Stay with me!
-Hurry!

07:38.583 --> 07:39.667
How long has he been out?

07:39.750 --> 07:41.752
-About ten minutes.
-Got it.

08:09.405 --> 08:11.866
This place is deserted.

08:15.036 --> 08:16.746
Fuck!

08:33.971 --> 08:35.389
Damn it!

08:53.783 --> 08:55.243
Hold on!

09:08.923 --> 09:09.757
Hello.

09:09.840 --> 09:11.050
-Tae-yeong.
-Hello.

09:12.093 --> 09:14.345
Come on in. Watch your step.

09:16.556 --> 09:18.057
I'm so sorry.

09:18.140 --> 09:19.517
You shouldn't be.

09:19.600 --> 09:23.312
You've been feeding me
a ton of side dishes all this time.

09:23.813 --> 09:26.315
I'm just happy I get to return the favor.

09:26.399 --> 09:29.694
Thank you for saying yes
on such short notice.

09:30.278 --> 09:32.280
Of course. We are family.

09:33.239 --> 09:36.659
You two can use this room.
I'll get you some blankets.

09:36.742 --> 09:38.202
This way, Ms. Yoon.

09:42.456 --> 09:44.125
You can use this room.

09:44.208 --> 09:47.795
My sister uses it once in a while,
but she's in the US now.

09:48.296 --> 09:49.380
Thank you.

09:49.880 --> 09:51.966
-Tae-yeong.
-Yes!

10:07.898 --> 10:09.984
It's nothing serious.

10:10.901 --> 10:12.820
Could you check something for me?

10:14.155 --> 10:15.239
Sure.

10:17.199 --> 10:18.576
NO RESULTS FOUND FOR "IKFC"

10:37.386 --> 10:38.721
NO RESULTS FOUND FOR "IKFC"

10:42.767 --> 10:44.268
I should check the dark web.

10:44.935 --> 10:45.895
What?

10:46.479 --> 10:47.313
What's that?

10:47.980 --> 10:48.814
Well…

10:50.066 --> 10:53.486
The web we use every day
is like the iceberg above the surface.

10:53.569 --> 10:55.696
The dark web is below the surface.

10:55.780 --> 10:57.448
It's completely anonymous,

10:57.531 --> 11:01.243
so it's a haven
for criminals dodging the radar.

11:01.327 --> 11:04.622
Completely anonymous? What does that mean?

11:06.374 --> 11:09.377
Whenever we go online,
we leave an IP trail.

11:09.460 --> 11:11.420
An IP address is like a digital ID.

11:11.504 --> 11:15.508
So when online crimes occur,
we can track IPs to catch criminals.

11:15.591 --> 11:19.470
But dark web IPs are encrypted
and virtually untraceable.

11:19.553 --> 11:21.555
It's impossible to track the user.

11:21.639 --> 11:24.850
Criminals exploit this
to create underground black markets,

11:24.934 --> 11:26.852
using Bitcoin for transactions.

11:26.936 --> 11:29.689
Wow, you really know your stuff.

11:32.650 --> 11:35.611
Back when we met,
I was in the cyber division,

11:35.695 --> 11:38.072
tracking and taking down these websites.

11:38.155 --> 11:44.120
Some sites I shut down sold drugs,
while others distributed IEDs and poisons.

11:44.620 --> 11:46.497
Some even offered murder-for-hire,

11:46.580 --> 11:50.751
where, shockingly, you could actually
choose the method of execution.

11:50.835 --> 11:55.339
They offered things like torture-murders,
acid disposal, and staged suicides.

11:56.841 --> 11:58.259
I still remember the admin ID.

11:58.342 --> 12:00.511
M-A-N-J-I,

12:00.594 --> 12:03.305
the English spelling
of the Buddhist symbol.

12:03.806 --> 12:04.849
Isn't it ironic?

12:04.932 --> 12:07.560
For a hitman to go by a name like that.

12:08.853 --> 12:11.230
Anyway, I'm going in.

12:25.745 --> 12:27.079
Found it.

12:35.546 --> 12:38.132
FASTER, STRONGER, BLOODIER
FIGHT, MONEY, BLOOD - TAKE THE MONEY!

12:56.776 --> 12:58.986
Man, his skin split open so easily.

13:19.673 --> 13:20.633
What is this?

13:25.304 --> 13:26.263
What's wrong?

13:27.723 --> 13:32.353
They want a credit card,
but never enter your card info here.

13:32.436 --> 13:35.981
You never know who'll hack it
and exploit your data.

13:36.065 --> 13:38.984
Can't you hack into it or something?

13:39.568 --> 13:44.615
If I do that,
the site admins will be able to see me.

13:44.698 --> 13:46.617
If they're faster than me,

13:46.700 --> 13:51.372
they'll breach my system
before I can even get into theirs.

13:51.455 --> 13:53.541
They can infect the system
and hold it hostage.

13:54.041 --> 13:58.462
The dark web is home to elite hackers,
far beyond anything I could imagine.

13:58.963 --> 14:01.507
-I'm sorry.
-Please. Don't be.

14:12.852 --> 14:14.103
But then…

14:14.186 --> 14:15.813
But then, what?

14:18.065 --> 14:21.318
We just need to avoid
using our credit cards, right?

14:22.278 --> 14:24.947
Well, that's true.

14:33.122 --> 14:34.039
Woo-jin.

14:38.711 --> 14:41.589
Should we ask

14:42.256 --> 14:43.299
Mr. Moon?

14:45.301 --> 14:48.762
Are you thinking of a mule card?

14:52.099 --> 14:57.229
Mule cards use stolen IDs,
so innocent people end up taking the fall.

14:58.939 --> 15:00.107
And if they are dead?

15:02.192 --> 15:05.112
Well…

15:05.195 --> 15:07.740
I'll pretend I didn't hear that.

15:14.038 --> 15:14.872
Gun-woo.

15:15.497 --> 15:16.332
Yeah?

15:16.999 --> 15:20.169
You should stay here
and protect your mom and Tae-yeong.

15:20.836 --> 15:21.670
Hold on.

15:21.754 --> 15:23.756
Anything could happen, okay?

15:23.839 --> 15:27.468
I'll go talk to Mr. Moon.

15:31.472 --> 15:32.765
Okay, I got it.

15:46.236 --> 15:47.905
There goes one.

15:49.531 --> 15:51.200
Which one? Gun-woo?

15:51.700 --> 15:53.535
No, the other one.

16:37.079 --> 16:37.913
In-beom.

16:39.206 --> 16:43.335
I'm the one who got you out of jail.

16:44.336 --> 16:46.338
Thanks for taking the deal.

16:46.422 --> 16:48.674
Let's recruit Kim Gun-woo…

16:55.597 --> 16:58.058
Aren't you here because you took the deal?

17:06.483 --> 17:08.152
This puts me in a bind.

17:13.449 --> 17:14.283
You.

17:14.867 --> 17:15.784
Kang In-beom.

17:20.247 --> 17:22.624
There's nothing within a 10 km radius.

17:23.709 --> 17:26.670
Leave this warehouse,
and I'm calling the cops.

17:29.089 --> 17:31.467
They'll be here in ten minutes tops.

17:32.634 --> 17:34.136
No matter how fast you are,

17:35.137 --> 17:37.723
you can't run 10 km in 10 minutes.

17:48.150 --> 17:50.235
I can drive a car.

18:03.040 --> 18:05.209
Where do you think you're going, bastard?

18:05.793 --> 18:07.461
You son of a bitch!

18:09.546 --> 18:11.006
Son of a bitch!

18:14.218 --> 18:15.552
Son of a bitch!

18:17.179 --> 18:18.263
You fuckface!

18:39.451 --> 18:40.285
Bastard!

19:01.849 --> 19:04.560
Fucking bastards!

19:14.653 --> 19:17.739
Come at me, you fucking bastards!

19:23.912 --> 19:26.081
Those morons.

19:31.086 --> 19:34.339
Get up, you bastards! Get the hell up!

19:35.299 --> 19:36.675
Fuck!

20:27.517 --> 20:28.644
Bring it.

20:28.727 --> 20:30.312
I'll end you.

20:55.796 --> 20:57.923
For fuck's sake.

21:04.930 --> 21:05.764
Hey.

21:06.390 --> 21:07.224
You.

21:07.975 --> 21:10.269
I thought you were a weak little shit,
but you're not.

21:12.104 --> 21:14.523
That was some half-assed boxing you did.

21:18.110 --> 21:20.028
I'm gonna cash in on Gun-woo.

21:22.281 --> 21:23.699
I'll cut you in.

21:24.366 --> 21:25.200
Stick with me.

21:31.415 --> 21:33.834
Fuck off, you bastard.

22:05.949 --> 22:07.284
Salute!

22:14.166 --> 22:16.043
Salute!

22:27.220 --> 22:28.180
At ease.

22:30.098 --> 22:32.351
-At ease.
-Hong Woo-jin, 1,216th Marine Class.

22:33.101 --> 22:33.935
Ack!

22:34.019 --> 22:38.690
I, a senior Marine,
am incredibly proud of my juniors.

22:38.774 --> 22:40.942
It's not because Gun-woo won the title!

22:41.026 --> 22:42.819
Until he won the title,

22:42.903 --> 22:45.364
our junior marines stuck together

22:45.447 --> 22:48.200
and toughed it out like true Marines.

22:48.283 --> 22:50.202
It's the process I'm proud of!

22:50.702 --> 22:51.745
You understand?

22:52.496 --> 22:53.330
Ack!

22:57.459 --> 22:59.002
Now, give me a hug.

23:03.006 --> 23:04.841
You did great. Look at you.

23:04.925 --> 23:08.762
What happened to your face, kiddo?

23:08.845 --> 23:10.680
Look at this kid.

23:15.435 --> 23:17.187
They came all the way to the house?

23:17.270 --> 23:18.188
Yes.

23:20.107 --> 23:22.317
Their intel beats the military's.

23:22.401 --> 23:24.778
They brought
a one-billion-won signing bonus in cash.

23:24.861 --> 23:26.488
-One billion won?
-Yes.

23:26.571 --> 23:30.283
And they'd give us up to 15 billion won
if he fought just one match.

23:30.367 --> 23:32.077
They're offering

23:33.745 --> 23:36.081
15 billion won in fight money
for one match?

23:40.502 --> 23:42.504
An operation of that scale

23:43.004 --> 23:45.424
is more than anyone in this country
can handle.

23:45.507 --> 23:49.219
That's right. They claim
four million members worldwide.

23:49.302 --> 23:52.264
Four million? Where is it being broadcast?

23:52.347 --> 23:54.933
Sir, there's this thing
called the dark web.

23:56.435 --> 23:58.437
The Internet we usually use…

23:58.937 --> 24:00.397
You know, the iceberg…

24:00.480 --> 24:02.441
-It's above the surface and below--
-Yeah.

24:03.233 --> 24:05.152
Yeah, I know.

24:05.694 --> 24:06.820
Dark web.

24:08.321 --> 24:10.699
I only just learned about this today.

24:10.782 --> 24:14.453
So, they stream the fights
on the dark web,

24:14.953 --> 24:17.247
and the viewers bet on it. Is that it?

24:17.747 --> 24:18.748
I think so.

24:18.832 --> 24:20.250
But

24:20.917 --> 24:23.962
if a real champion like Gun-woo joins…

24:25.714 --> 24:26.631
well,

24:27.132 --> 24:31.887
that underground boxing world
would get absolutely pumped.

24:31.970 --> 24:32.804
Why?

24:34.097 --> 24:36.808
Gun-woo alone
would raise their status big-time.

24:37.392 --> 24:39.978
Whether it's 1 billion or 15 billion won,

24:40.061 --> 24:43.732
they pour all that money in
because they'll make more back.

24:44.983 --> 24:46.026
You're right.

24:46.526 --> 24:47.360
So…

24:49.404 --> 24:51.615
how can I help?

24:51.698 --> 24:55.577
To access their website,
we need to sign up for membership.

24:56.077 --> 25:00.207
We need a credit card,
but the moment your info's out there--

25:00.290 --> 25:02.292
You need a mule card.

25:03.418 --> 25:05.587
I sincerely respect you, sir.

25:07.589 --> 25:08.757
Sun-bo.

25:08.840 --> 25:09.966
-Yes.
-Here.

25:10.050 --> 25:12.761
-Bring me three mule cards.
-Okay.

25:12.844 --> 25:14.179
The premium ones.

25:14.262 --> 25:15.305
Okay.

25:18.350 --> 25:19.726
Finish your coffee.

25:21.353 --> 25:22.187
Thanks.

25:24.064 --> 25:26.316
Here, go splurge.

25:29.110 --> 25:30.654
Thank you, sir.

25:30.737 --> 25:33.323
Who's helping you now?

25:35.325 --> 25:36.409
For now,

25:37.160 --> 25:39.704
Gun-woo and I will handle it ourselves.

25:43.124 --> 25:44.125
Come on, Woo-jin.

25:44.751 --> 25:48.171
The way I see it,
these guys are global villains.

25:48.255 --> 25:49.464
You follow me?

25:49.548 --> 25:50.966
Yes, I'm aware.

25:51.466 --> 25:53.718
But we got stronger
from taking down Kim Myeong-gil.

25:57.556 --> 26:01.434
I don't think that's the reason.

26:01.935 --> 26:03.562
I find it odd.

26:04.396 --> 26:06.481
Why aren't you asking for my help?

26:08.608 --> 26:10.026
Gun-woo and I talked.

26:10.777 --> 26:13.863
We don't want to drag you into this again.

26:13.947 --> 26:16.700
Hong Woo-jin, 1,216th Marine Class.

26:16.783 --> 26:18.994
Hong Woo-jin, 1,216th Marine Class, sir!

26:19.703 --> 26:20.704
Did you forget?

26:21.204 --> 26:25.500
You mess with one Marine,
you mess with all Marines.

26:25.584 --> 26:29.921
Besides, if I just hang back
while you are in trouble…

26:33.383 --> 26:35.343
what would Mr. Choi

26:36.386 --> 26:38.221
think of me in heaven?

26:39.764 --> 26:41.016
And as for me,

26:42.142 --> 26:44.728
I have a responsibility
as a senior Marine.

26:48.940 --> 26:51.234
Two is better than one.

26:51.735 --> 26:55.322
And three would be better
than you two, right?

26:58.241 --> 26:59.326
Hold my hand.

27:01.119 --> 27:02.329
I'm your senior.

27:03.163 --> 27:04.831
I will support you all the way.

27:13.131 --> 27:15.675
Oh man. He's not even budging.

27:17.218 --> 27:19.346
By the way, did you come here alone?

27:19.429 --> 27:21.556
Yes. Gun-woo is with his mother.

27:21.640 --> 27:24.309
You naive punk.

27:24.809 --> 27:27.228
I'm asking if you've been followed.

27:27.854 --> 27:29.606
Come on. Look at you.

27:29.689 --> 27:31.650
They came right to your front door.

27:31.733 --> 27:33.443
You think they'll just sit back?

27:36.446 --> 27:37.906
-Is that your car?
-Yes.

27:37.989 --> 27:39.491
Listen.

27:39.574 --> 27:42.952
Drive around the neighborhood
and come back here.

27:43.036 --> 27:45.789
Let's see what these bastards look like.

27:56.424 --> 27:57.425
He's out.

28:05.141 --> 28:06.685
-Sun-bo.
-Yes.

28:07.602 --> 28:08.728
Write this down.

28:09.437 --> 28:10.271
On it.

28:22.867 --> 28:25.745
One, four, three, nine,
two, two, nine, zero.

28:53.898 --> 28:55.024
We've been here already.

28:55.608 --> 28:56.568
No.

29:08.705 --> 29:09.539
That's the one.

29:10.331 --> 29:12.876
-Avante, right?
-Yes.

29:14.085 --> 29:15.170
See you later, sir.

29:17.172 --> 29:19.841
Woo-jin, don't look back. Just drive.

29:20.341 --> 29:21.551
Where did you go today?

29:22.051 --> 29:25.722
Gun-woo, his mom, and I packed up
and went to Tae-yeong's place.

29:25.805 --> 29:28.808
First, call Gun-woo.
Tell him to move his mother.

29:28.892 --> 29:30.935
They could burst in any second.

29:31.019 --> 29:32.729
And I'll send you an address.

29:32.812 --> 29:35.565
Lure them there.
We'll catch them and squeeze them.

29:43.281 --> 29:45.116
WOO-JIN

29:46.910 --> 29:47.744
Yes, Woo-jin.

29:47.827 --> 29:50.455
Gun-woo, listen closely and stay calm.

29:52.707 --> 29:53.583
Okay.

29:53.666 --> 29:56.294
Take Mom and Tae-yeong
and get out of there now.

29:56.878 --> 29:57.754
What?

29:57.837 --> 29:59.714
We've been followed.

30:03.051 --> 30:05.220
And we also exposed Tae-yeong.

30:05.804 --> 30:07.180
Take her with you.

30:09.307 --> 30:10.850
Okay, got it.

30:11.726 --> 30:12.811
Where are you going?

30:12.894 --> 30:14.103
Me? I'm…

30:14.604 --> 30:17.649
Mr. Moon and I are gonna grab
the guys tailing us.

30:18.358 --> 30:19.484
Keep your mom safe.

30:19.567 --> 30:20.819
Tae-yeong too.

30:21.361 --> 30:22.195
Okay.

30:22.862 --> 30:23.988
But, Woo-jin…

30:25.990 --> 30:27.116
where should we go?

30:28.243 --> 30:30.203
I can only think of Min-beom.

30:30.286 --> 30:33.206
We have no other choice.
You have to move fast.

30:33.706 --> 30:35.166
Okay, got it.

30:35.250 --> 30:36.584
Be careful.

30:56.354 --> 30:59.691
MIN-BEOM

31:13.371 --> 31:17.458
The person you've called is unavailable.
Please leave a message…

31:22.088 --> 31:23.172
Tae-yeong.

31:25.300 --> 31:27.510
I'm really sorry.

31:28.094 --> 31:30.513
We've put you in danger.

31:31.055 --> 31:34.726
I think they followed us here.

31:39.355 --> 31:40.982
I shouldn't be here, right?

31:42.859 --> 31:43.693
I'm afraid so.

31:44.235 --> 31:45.820
They could burst in any second.

31:45.904 --> 31:47.155
I'll pack my things.

31:48.239 --> 31:50.575
-I'm so sorry.
-Please don't worry.

31:52.744 --> 31:54.495
Where should we go?

31:55.038 --> 31:56.664
Well…

31:58.458 --> 32:00.209
I'll ask around. Just a moment.

32:11.179 --> 32:12.263
Hello?

32:12.347 --> 32:15.683
Hello, Gun-woo.
This is Cho, President Hong's secretary.

32:17.560 --> 32:18.645
Yes, hello.

32:18.728 --> 32:19.562
The thing is,

32:19.646 --> 32:22.941
he's in an important meeting
with international partners,

32:23.024 --> 32:25.485
so he told me to call you before he can.

32:25.568 --> 32:27.236
What can I do for you?

32:27.946 --> 32:30.198
I was going to tell Min-beom.

32:30.907 --> 32:32.951
Please feel free to tell me anything.

32:34.118 --> 32:35.411
My family

32:36.245 --> 32:37.580
is in danger.

32:39.582 --> 32:40.792
My mother

32:41.542 --> 32:44.003
needs a safe place to stay.

32:44.587 --> 32:49.050
Come straight to our office building.
I'll have the bodyguards on standby.

32:49.759 --> 32:51.177
How else can I help?

32:51.260 --> 32:53.179
Do you happen to have

32:53.721 --> 32:56.933
a motorcycle I can borrow?

32:57.850 --> 33:01.104
I need to go save Woo-jin,
but I'm worried about the traffic.

33:01.854 --> 33:02.855
Yes, sure.

33:02.939 --> 33:04.983
What kind of motorcycle?

33:05.066 --> 33:08.152
Just something fast. I can ride anything.

33:08.236 --> 33:10.989
I'll prepare the fastest one possible.

33:11.489 --> 33:12.782
Okay, thank you.

33:44.063 --> 33:45.064
Everything okay?

33:45.148 --> 33:46.691
Yes. Wait.

33:49.819 --> 33:50.903
They're getting away.

33:50.987 --> 33:51.863
What?

33:51.946 --> 33:53.448
They're hitting the elevator!

33:53.531 --> 33:54.532
Who?

33:54.615 --> 33:57.618
Gun-woo, his mom,
and the woman in the wheelchair.

33:58.494 --> 33:59.579
What should we do?

34:05.001 --> 34:07.003
-What?
-Sir.

34:08.129 --> 34:09.964
I'll get Woo-jin instead of the mother.

34:11.090 --> 34:13.593
-So what?
-I need a place and people.

34:16.721 --> 34:17.722
Send him some guys.

34:17.805 --> 34:18.973
Yes, sir.

34:39.410 --> 34:40.244
Hello.

34:40.328 --> 34:44.040
-Please look after my mom and Tae-yeong.
-Sure.

34:44.123 --> 34:45.249
-Please help.
-Sure.

34:48.044 --> 34:49.587
And the motorcycle?

34:49.670 --> 34:50.671
Right this way.

34:59.889 --> 35:01.182
Will this work?

35:01.265 --> 35:02.100
Yes.

35:09.107 --> 35:10.066
WOO-JIN

35:23.454 --> 35:24.372
Be safe.

35:25.039 --> 35:25.998
I will.

35:39.178 --> 35:40.429
Where are you?

35:40.513 --> 35:45.852
I'm at the light by the elementary school.
I'll be at the auto shop after this light.

35:45.935 --> 35:47.395
Okay, I'm on my way now.

36:04.871 --> 36:06.205
LEE DONG-HYEON
MANAGER

36:06.289 --> 36:07.582
Yes.

36:08.166 --> 36:12.461
There's a factory five minutes from you.
It's quiet there.

36:14.088 --> 36:15.173
Send me the address.

36:15.256 --> 36:16.632
Okay, I will.

36:17.133 --> 36:18.718
We're on our way too.

36:23.306 --> 36:24.348
Damn it.

36:24.432 --> 36:25.808
That crazy bastard.

36:26.893 --> 36:28.352
Where the fuck is he going?

36:37.028 --> 36:38.404
He just got off the road.

36:38.487 --> 36:40.031
I'll send you the new address.

37:26.911 --> 37:28.329
Was it you, fucker?

37:31.874 --> 37:32.875
Fuck!

37:36.462 --> 37:37.546
Fuck!

37:42.426 --> 37:43.636
Damn it.

37:45.763 --> 37:47.056
Let go, you bastard.

37:56.148 --> 37:57.858
Get off!

38:11.414 --> 38:12.248
Get off!

38:18.838 --> 38:19.797
Fuck!

38:32.268 --> 38:34.020
Whoa!

38:43.863 --> 38:45.573
Son of a bitch!

38:47.241 --> 38:48.617
Are you okay, sir?

38:48.701 --> 38:50.911
Nope. Feels like there's a hole
in my head.

38:50.995 --> 38:52.246
You'll be okay.

38:52.330 --> 38:53.748
But I'm bleeding like crazy.

38:53.831 --> 38:55.291
A Marine's blood is sweat.

38:56.083 --> 38:57.376
A Marine's blood is…

38:57.918 --> 38:59.545
Cut the bullshit.

38:59.628 --> 39:00.463
Ack!

39:11.182 --> 39:12.433
Sir.

39:14.769 --> 39:16.896
You've gotta be shitting me, fuckers.

39:49.595 --> 39:50.846
Woo-jin!

40:09.198 --> 40:11.492
Drop it. Put it down, you bastard!

40:14.453 --> 40:15.538
Let it go, fucker!

40:27.216 --> 40:28.175
Fuck you!

40:55.786 --> 40:57.121
I told you to shut up.

41:04.378 --> 41:05.754
Sir!

41:07.089 --> 41:08.340
Woo-jin!

41:34.492 --> 41:36.285
Sir!

41:42.374 --> 41:43.334
Are you okay?

41:43.417 --> 41:46.337
Yes, but my left hand hurts like hell.

41:46.420 --> 41:47.505
Nah, you are okay.

41:48.297 --> 41:50.257
A Marine's blood is sweat.

41:50.341 --> 41:52.885
A reservist's blood
is just plain old blood.

41:54.220 --> 41:55.596
Let's put him in the car.

41:55.679 --> 41:56.680
Okay, sir.

41:59.099 --> 42:00.100
-Sir.
-What?

42:02.686 --> 42:03.854
What the…

42:09.485 --> 42:10.611
Who the hell are they?

42:15.366 --> 42:17.576
Do they have a work dinner here or what?

42:19.870 --> 42:21.539
-Sir.
-Yes.

42:22.039 --> 42:23.040
Let's go.

42:23.123 --> 42:24.959
Catch those fucking bastards!

42:25.459 --> 42:26.377
Hurry!

42:28.254 --> 42:30.548
-Hurry!
-You're dead meat!

42:31.215 --> 42:33.008
-Catch them! Hurry!
-Hurry!

42:33.092 --> 42:33.926
Sir!

42:34.009 --> 42:36.011
Assholes! Get them! You bastards!

42:36.095 --> 42:37.179
Woo-jin!

42:37.263 --> 42:38.514
-Go up!
-Here!

42:45.729 --> 42:47.064
Sir!

42:49.066 --> 42:50.901
Get up there! Hurry, bastards!

42:57.575 --> 42:58.909
You fucker!

43:00.327 --> 43:01.662
Son of a bitch!

43:02.246 --> 43:03.163
Sir!

43:05.416 --> 43:08.419
Woo-jin, I'm not gonna die! Just go!

43:09.712 --> 43:10.546
Ack!

43:14.425 --> 43:15.551
Catch that bastard!

43:19.513 --> 43:20.389
Son of a bitch!

43:20.472 --> 43:21.640
Goddamn it!

43:41.952 --> 43:42.995
Shit.

43:47.750 --> 43:49.084
Get him!

43:49.168 --> 43:50.836
-Fuckers!
-Stop, you bastard!

43:50.919 --> 43:52.755
Fuck!

44:04.600 --> 44:05.684
You bastard.

44:08.562 --> 44:09.647
Stop him, damn it!

44:11.231 --> 44:13.025
-Die, bastard!
-Come here, fucker!

44:16.487 --> 44:18.364
Fuck! Come and get me, you thugs!

44:18.447 --> 44:19.865
Go after him!

44:19.948 --> 44:20.866
Fucking hell.

44:20.949 --> 44:22.451
Damn, they sure come fast.

44:23.035 --> 44:23.869
Fuck!

44:23.952 --> 44:26.038
-Son of a bitch!
-Where are you going?

44:26.121 --> 44:28.540
-Son of a bitch!
-You're dead meat, fucker!

44:28.624 --> 44:29.708
You're fucking dead!

44:30.542 --> 44:33.253
-Fucking bastard!
-You son of a bitch!

44:41.053 --> 44:42.346
Son of a bitch!

44:45.891 --> 44:47.142
-Moron.
-Fuck!

44:47.643 --> 44:49.144
Kill him, damn it!

44:49.228 --> 44:50.396
You fucker!

45:02.991 --> 45:03.826
Fucking prick!

45:05.411 --> 45:07.246
Die, you son of a bitch!

45:08.539 --> 45:10.249
You son of a bitch!

45:16.714 --> 45:18.549
Get over here, fucker!

45:21.802 --> 45:23.178
Fucking bastard!

45:23.262 --> 45:25.097
Son of a bitch!

45:25.180 --> 45:26.932
What are you looking at, fucker?

45:27.433 --> 45:29.601
-Son of a bitch!
-Fucker!

45:29.685 --> 45:31.937
-Fucking bastard!
-Son of a bitch!

45:36.859 --> 45:37.693
Fuck!

46:21.653 --> 46:23.781
-Hey.
-Wait, look.

46:25.032 --> 46:26.658
-What the?
-What?

46:27.367 --> 46:28.368
What the hell?

46:29.536 --> 46:31.413
Who the fuck is that?

46:31.497 --> 46:32.998
My fucking back. Damn it.

46:36.001 --> 46:37.377
Fuck. What now?

46:37.461 --> 46:38.754
Fucking moron.

46:40.756 --> 46:42.007
Who the hell are you?

46:59.858 --> 47:02.110
How dare you, you piece of shit!

47:02.736 --> 47:04.947
-Fucking bastard!
-Son of a bitch!

47:06.365 --> 47:09.034
What the hell, bastard? You crazy fucker!

47:14.498 --> 47:15.958
Hey, grab him!

47:24.216 --> 47:25.634
You son of a bitch!

47:29.096 --> 47:30.347
Son of a bitch!

47:31.306 --> 47:32.558
You son of a bitch!

47:32.641 --> 47:33.600
Fucking bastard!

47:50.200 --> 47:51.493
Fucker!

48:08.343 --> 48:09.469
Fucking bastard!

48:10.929 --> 48:12.139
Die, you bastard!

48:14.182 --> 48:15.017
Fucking bastard.

48:23.066 --> 48:24.985
Damn, you can fight.

48:25.652 --> 48:26.820
Fucking bastard!

48:28.697 --> 48:30.032
Fuck!

48:50.010 --> 48:51.386
Gun-woo.

48:53.597 --> 48:54.806
Gun-woo!

48:56.141 --> 48:57.726
Gun-woo!

49:01.313 --> 49:02.230
Woo-jin!

49:05.567 --> 49:06.610
Are you okay?

49:08.487 --> 49:09.321
I am.

49:09.404 --> 49:10.572
Oh no…

49:15.827 --> 49:16.870
Your hand!

49:20.415 --> 49:21.333
Gun-woo.

49:21.416 --> 49:22.626
-Yes.
-Mr. Moon.

49:22.709 --> 49:23.835
Right.

49:26.338 --> 49:27.214
Sir.

49:29.925 --> 49:31.593
-Gun-woo.
-Yes.

49:34.763 --> 49:36.264
Let's get out of here.

49:37.641 --> 49:38.475
Yes.

49:39.267 --> 49:40.102
Woo-jin.

49:40.185 --> 49:41.061
Yeah.

52:47.038 --> 52:52.043
Subtitle translation by: Jooyea Lee
